          style="font-weight: bold;">RabbitMQ</span></span></font><small><span
        style="font-family: Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span
          style="font-weight: bold;"> startup</span>:<br>
        <br>
      </span></small><small><span style="font-family: Times New
        Roman,Times,serif;">Of course, MyWabbit should already be
