        style="font-family: Times New Roman,Times,serif;"></span></small><font
      size="-1"><br>
      <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 153);"></span></font><small><span
        style="font-family: Times New Roman,Times,serif;"></span></small><span
      style="font-weight: bold;"><br>
    </span><span style="font-weight: bold;">STEP 7</span>:<br>
    <span style="font-family: Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span
        style="font-weight: bold;"><small><br>
          Execute. <br>
        </small></span></span><small><span style="font-family: Times New
        Roman,Times,serif;"><br>
        The WebServer should still be running.&nbsp; Go to the webapp
        with the create new user page (</span></small><small><span
        style="font-family: Times New Roman,Times,serif;">http://localhost:8080/mpcs/jsps/starter.kit.html)









        and enter a new user and a new user password.&nbsp; Click on the
        button. <br>
        <br>
        Then, navigate to your LoggingService terminal, and see if you
        have new output.&nbsp; You should see a lot of MONGODB:...
        output, but the last line should be "Message To Log: {...}" and
        you should see that the newPassword is set to the password you
        entered and the newUserName field is set to the new user name
        you entered.<br>
        <br>
        Hit control-C (^-C) to exit out of the Recv program, and then
